# The operator image (build/Dockerfile) only needs a small, well-defined set of paths. Ignore everything and
# then re-include exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs, so unrelated changes (tests, docs, helm, IDE files, the
# local bin/ toolchain, etc.) never enter the build context or invalidate the build cache.
# Keep this allowlist in sync with the COPY instructions in build/Dockerfile.
*

# Go modules (downloaded before source is copied, to cache dependencies)
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Git metadata and build tooling used during the image build
!.git
!build
!hack
!Makefile
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Operator source
!main.go
!version
!api
!controllers
